{
    "type": "game",
    "name": "Beyond",
    "steam_appid": 2874590,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2874590/extras/d8a41d210105fd3ab19183092f859d16.avif?t=1720441043\" width=600 height=133 /></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2874590/extras/cd2ef55b4de9c5b343606dc48ea4b4e8.avif?t=1720441043\" width=600 height=333 /></span><br>Survey the solar system to maximize development and discover where your foes have already established operations. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2874590/extras/628728690d5b471eb74e6b361e6989ee.avif?t=1720441043\" width=600 height=333 /></span><br>Build structures, manufacture ships, and develop technologies to surpass enemy factions in your expansion through the solar system. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2874590/extras/3b7d58c97321b5ee33c646cb0e71afb7.avif?t=1720441043\" width=600 height=333 /></span><br>Utilize captured enemy structures to turn the tables against them in combat and resource acquisition. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2874590/extras/69665fa0f3922ec0ae02477d3ac5c061.avif?t=1720441043\" width=600 height=333 /></span><br>Drive opposing factions from the solar system until only the most dominant remains. <br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2874590/extras/1191133a8a5f8aa15f0ed1053a192dba.avif?t=1720441043\" width=600 height=133 /></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2874590/extras/82c3c5190f002872f301c10bc4969e7b.avif?t=1720441043\" width=600 height=333 /></span><br>Hailing from the temperate biomes of Gaia, the bipedal community-oriented hominids focus their collective effort on incremental gains across the spectrum, starting weaker and ending stronger than the average species.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2874590/extras/c199e0af6af98d8a66bdd6d655562c9a.avif?t=1720441043\" width=600 height=333 /></span><br>Rising from the ashes of their creators\u2019 self-destruction, Botica are a mechanical species that specializes in efficiency of resources and optimization of technology.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2874590/extras/aa0cc3ab61ff8e8ffe5179878249e694.avif?t=1720441043\" width=600 height=333 /></span><br>Not content with the exo-political powers that be, the Sistren expand their reach on the promise of future riches for all who join their ranks\u2026 No matter what tactics it takes to gain them.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2874590/extras/3e806b13b1ac25b2ce0a7fb7323dd1a3.avif?t=1720441043\" width=600 height=333 /></span><br>Arising from their Foundress, Manta are insectoids that grow everything they need to expand their domain. The very exoskeletons in which they reside are living entities.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2874590/extras/67f723c559b41dd42b7c40c584baa21a.avif?t=1720441043\" width=600 height=333 /></span><br>Embryophytics that rose to sentience on a lush world, but were forced to set off into the cosmos when their planet\u2019s atmosphere was eviscerated by relentless solar flares. Biological adaptation to the harshest environments has allowed them to travel far and wide in search of a new home.<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2874590/extras/1207530dc422679c99ad52edbf343ff1.avif?t=1720441043\" width=600 height=133 /></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2874590/extras/248e7fbe1b9fb51b87b51d00006bbde0.avif?t=1720441043\" width=600 height=200 /></span><br>At the end of every round, all celestial bodies orbit around the sun, moving at different speeds and shuffling the positions of ships, structures, and resources. Ships can enter or leave orbit, giving them tactical advantage in positioning for future combat.   <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2874590/extras/f13a04c0a01909e19aa9c9ffc0333182.avif?t=1720441043\" width=600 height=200 /></span><br>Discover who is out there, and if someone else has already set up operations where you planned to. Visibility is gained and lost as ships maneuver and structures orbit, meaning the tactical landscape can change when you\u2019re not looking. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2874590/extras/7bdfab5398e464d18035e2ec776ab9f0.avif?t=1720441043\" width=600 height=200 /></span><br>Compete with opposing factions to gather resources, while managing the upkeep of your force to maintain combat prowess. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2874590/extras/565566c1a36d8058699c8baf4ddf5ce3.avif?t=1720441043\" width=600 height=200 /></span><br>Capture structures of different species and, in some cases, use their own technology against them. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2874590/extras/333345c7c2dc069705099f037f27758d.avif?t=1720441043\" width=600 height=200 /></span><br>Use the actions of ships and structures to advance up your species\u2019 unique technology tree, unlocking more powerful means to conqueror your foes. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2874590/extras/473e9d2020d5622af9052f47194f3308.avif?t=1720441043\" width=600 height=200 /></span><br>If you so desire, dive into the unique stats of every ship and structure to figure out which are best suited to maximize the destruction of your enemies. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2874590/extras/b3ec0057b5cf4583d778172662d061d8.avif?t=1720441043\" width=600 height=200 /></span><br>Like to run the numbers? See how you are doing compared to previous games and weigh just how effective your strategies are. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2874590/extras/ea3d1c8095f35ed628b3f016461812d8.avif?t=1720441043\" width=600 height=200 /></span><br>Danger, Will Robinson!",
    "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2874590/extras/d8a41d210105fd3ab19183092f859d16.avif?t=1720441043\" width=600 height=133 /></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2874590/extras/cd2ef55b4de9c5b343606dc48ea4b4e8.avif?t=1720441043\" width=600 height=333 /></span><br>Survey the solar system to maximize development and discover where your foes have already established operations. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2874590/extras/628728690d5b471eb74e6b361e6989ee.avif?t=1720441043\" width=600 height=333 /></span><br>Build structures, manufacture ships, and develop technologies to surpass enemy factions in your expansion through the solar system. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2874590/extras/3b7d58c97321b5ee33c646cb0e71afb7.avif?t=1720441043\" width=600 height=333 /></span><br>Utilize captured enemy structures to turn the tables against them in combat and resource acquisition. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2874590/extras/69665fa0f3922ec0ae02477d3ac5c061.avif?t=1720441043\" width=600 height=333 /></span><br>Drive opposing factions from the solar system until only the most dominant remains. <br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2874590/extras/1191133a8a5f8aa15f0ed1053a192dba.avif?t=1720441043\" width=600 height=133 /></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2874590/extras/82c3c5190f002872f301