ai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2874590/extras/333345c7c2dc069705099f037f27758d.avif?t=1720441043\" width=600 height=200 /></span><br>Use the actions of ships and structures to advance up your species\u2019 unique technology tree, unlocking more powerful means to conqueror your foes. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2874590/extras/473e9d2020d5622af9052f47194f3308.avif?t=1720441043\" width=600 height=200 /></span><br>If you so desire, dive into the unique stats of every ship and structure to figure out which are best suited to maximize the destruction of your enemies. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2874590/extras/b3ec0057b5cf4583d778172662d061d8.avif?t=1720441043\" width=600 height=200 /></span><br>Like to run the numbers? See how you are doing compared to previous games and weigh just how effective your strategies are. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2874590/extras/ea3d1c8095f35ed628b3f016461812d8.avif?t=1720441043\" width=600 height=200 /></span><br>Danger, Will Robinson!",
